# A notice with the reason and the fix, not a crash; Start only repeats it in the band.
title Net Toolbox: Ping without an ICMP socket
sizes 640x480 800x480 720x720 1024x600 1280x720
env NET_TOOLBOX_DEMO ping=unavailable
env NET_TOOLBOX_FIXTURE deck
env NET_TOOLBOX_LOG_DIR /tmp/nt-scene-logs
key down
key enter
shot notice
expect text "Ping is not available here"
key enter
shot refused
